# Vercel
.vercel

# Database dumps - these contain real financial data, never commit them.
# Prefer writing dumps outside the repo entirely (~/backups/finanzas/).
backups/
*.dump
*.sql.gz
!supabase/migrations/*.sql
!supabase/seed.sql
# Added by the Vercel CLI on `vercel link`. Broader than the rules above --
# it also covers .env.vercel and anything future tooling drops here.
.env*
# ...but the checked-in template is not a secret and must stay shareable.
!.env.development.local.example

# TypeScript -- both are generated. next-env.d.ts is rewritten by `next dev`/
# `next build` on every run, so committing it only creates conflicts.
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# UI design references (Figma Make + Stitch exports), kept on disk for
# comparison but not part of the app. They are self-contained Vite / React 19 /
# Tailwind v4 projects, so committing them would add a second lockfile and a
# second tsconfig to this repo. Drop these two lines if you'd rather track them.
Enhance Finance UI Design/
stitch_shadcn_ui_design_enhancement/
